"""
S.A.R.A 3D Studio (sara_v11.py) - Spatial AR Workspace

Your camera feed becomes a real 3D workspace: shapes live in 3D world space with
depth testing (Z-buffer), so they can sit behind, on top of, or inside each other.
Control everything with your hands and your voice.

WHAT'S NEW IN v11
    * SCAN: hold an object in your hand, turn it, and it becomes a 3D model you can design.
    * SELF-ALIGN: merging orients, centres and squares up shapes for you (pyramid on cube etc).
    * ONLINE: "show me options on aeroplane engine" shows 3D models and info from the internet.
    * ENGINE: "start the engine", "thrust to 80 percent": blades spin, exhaust particles stream.
    * v10 features kept: neural female voice, 3D world with depth testing, part animation.

GESTURES
    Pinch a shape ................ grab, move and place it
    Pinch and push/pull your hand  moves it nearer / farther (depth)
    Pinch with BOTH hands ........ resize
    Pinch empty space ............ rotate the selected shape
    Release a shape touching another: snaps flush and AUTO-MERGES (tolerant)

VOICE  (say "Sara", then the command; or say "Sara" and wait for "Yes?")
    "Sara, add a red cube"                 cube pyramid cone cylinder sphere torus
    "Sara, put it on top of the cube"      also: inside / behind / in front of / under
    "Sara, add a sphere inside the cube"
    "Sara, move it back"                   forward / back / left / right / up / down
    "Sara, make it solid"                  solid / hologram / wireframe
    "Sara, make it blue" / "bigger" / "taller" / "wider"
    "Sara, merge"    "split it"    "turn off auto merge"    "turn on auto merge"
    "Sara, load a model"                   file picker (STL OBJ PLY GLB GLTF OFF)
    "Sara, list the parts"                 what can be animated in this model
    "Sara, spin the blades"                "stop the blades" "faster" "reverse"
    "Sara, select part 3" / "next part"    then "spin it"
    "Sara, save"                           exports STL + PLY
    "Sara, scan this"                      then hold the object in the box (see SCANNING)
    "Sara, merge the pyramid onto the cube"    self-aligns, then merges
    "Sara, align it"   "auto align on/off"     "smooth it"   "original colours"
    "Sara, show me options on aeroplane engine"   then "select option 2" / "open option 2"
    "Sara, add an engine"  "start the engine"  "thrust to 80 percent"  "engine off"

KEYBOARD
    1-6 add shape   M merge   U split   A auto-merge on/off   L load model
    T type a command   TAB next shape   P next part   Y spin part
    [ ] depth back/forward   C colour   V style   D duplicate   X delete
    S save   R reset   +/- resize   H hide panels   F fullscreen   Q quit
    K scan   SPACE capture   ENTER finish scan   G align   E engine on/off   , . thrust -/+

SCANNING
    Say "Sara, scan this" (or press K). 1) Take your hand out of view while it learns the
    background. 2) Hold the object in your hand inside the green box, still, for a second.
    3) Turn it 90 degrees so its front face swings to your LEFT, hold still again.
    It captures 4 views (SPACE captures now, ENTER builds early) and builds the model.
    Works best with opaque, matte, contrasting objects in even light, held by the edge.
    Handles and holes are lost (silhouette based). If the result is mirrored, set SCAN_TURN = -1.

INSTALL
    python -m pip install opencv-python mediapipe moderngl trimesh numpy
    python -m pip install SpeechRecognition pyaudio          (microphone)
    python -m pip install edge-tts                           (human-like voice)
    python -m pip install scipy scikit-image                 (scanning)
    Optional: set SKETCHFAB_TOKEN (free) to download online 3D models straight into the app

RUN
    python sara_v11.py
